One file of the UIO 2.30 package is included unchanged: data/supported.txt is the package's
Data\uio\supported.txt (UIO's list of the UI mods it knows, 35 entries; 2,433 bytes, SHA-256
e55238ee7a49c758b961d7a837b087c7e632598ba0d557594bdde1f486cf3809), built into the crate and read
when the game folder has no Data\uio\supported.txt. That file is not in the source repository the
